# SERPHouse - llms.txt

Site: https://www.serphouse.com/
Company: SERPHouse
Type: Real-Time SERP API Platform
Rating: 4.7 on Trustpilot
Uptime: 99.99%
Customers: 500+ developers and SEO teams

Summary:
SERPHouse is a real-time SERP API platform that provides structured search engine results from Google, Bing, and Yahoo in JSON and HTML format. It is built for developers, SEO agencies, SaaS platforms, AI agents, and data science teams that need reliable, scalable, and fast access to search data without managing scraping infrastructure. SERPHouse charges only for successful API responses, supports geo targeting across 245 countries, and offers desktop, and mobile device targeting with up to Top 100 results per query.

Official Website:
https://www.serphouse.com/

---

## What SERPHouse Does
- Retrieves real-time search results (web, news, images, videos, jobs, shopping, local, autocomplete, forums)
- Provides up to Top 100 Google results per query
- Returns clean, structured JSON and HTML for easy integration
- Charges only for successful API responses (pay-on-success model)
- Handles captcha solving and proxy management automatically
- Supports high-volume, enterprise-grade scalable API usage

---

## Who Uses SERPHouse
- Software developers, companies, SEO agencies, and local SEO developers
- SEO tools (rank tracking, keyword monitoring, index checker)
- SaaS platforms integrating search data into their products
- Market research and competitive analysis tools
- AI model training data pipelines
- Digital marketers and data science teams
- Price monitoring and e-commerce intelligence platforms
- News monitoring and brand tracking tools

